# DFP-NEO-V2 Development Rules

## CRITICAL DEPLOYMENT RULE - MUST FOLLOW EVERY TIME

Railway deploys from `DFP-NEO-V2-fresh/` subdirectory ONLY.
NEVER make changes at the repository root - they will not be deployed.

### Before Every Commit:
1. Verify working directory is `/workspace/DFP-NEO-V2-fresh/`
2. Run `npm run build` if any React component was changed
3. Push to `feature/comprehensive-build-algorithm` branch ONLY (never `main`)

### Push Command:
```bash
git push https://x-access-token:$GITHUB_TOKEN@github.com/Dagde/DFP-NEO-V2.git HEAD:feature/comprehensive-build-algorithm
```